  "description": "Our meat- and dairy-free take on this smothered corn chip classic picks up some zip from a quick red onion-jalapeño pickle.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 1/2 avocado, sliced (optional); 1 tablespoon chopped cilantro (optional); 1 or 2 sliced scallions (optional); 1 lime wedge (optional)\n\nOptional substitutions: rice wine → distilled white vinegar; leftover vegan → vegetarian chili\n\nNotes: This recipe makes more pickled red onions than you need. Store leftover pickled red onions in a sealed container in the fridge for up to two months. You can use any vegetarian chili recipe you'd like, such as vegetarian chili, or vegan sweet potato and 2-bean chili with hominy.",
